# Local-only infrastructure notes (real IPs, OCIDs, SSH key paths, live
# secret values) -- must NEVER be committed or pushed. See
# local-infra/infrastructure.md's own warning banner for why this exists
# and the rules around it.
local-infra/

# settings.yml / settings.oracle.yml (repo root) are committed on
# purpose -- see their own header comments and CLAUDE.md's Landmines.
# They must never gain a real, this-deployment-specific value (a real
# OCID, IP, hostname, secret). The moment Phase 2+ needs one, it goes
# into a NEW file under local-infra/ (already gitignored above), not
# into either of these.

